<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Spur Auto Sales</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
}

body {
    background: #0d0d0d;
    color: white;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 10%;
    position: fixed;
    width: 100%;
    z-index: 1000;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

.logo {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.logo span {
    color: #e10600;
}

nav a {
    margin-left: 30px;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #e10600;
}

.hero {
    height: 100vh;
    background: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492144534655-ae79c964c9d7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 20px;
}

.hero-content {
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.7);
    padding: 50px;
    border-radius: 10px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: 60px;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
}

.hero p {
    margin: 20px 0;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 300;
}

.btn {
    padding: 15px 40px;
    border: none;
    background: #e10600;
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.3s;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.btn:hover {
    background: white;
    color: #e10600;
}

.section {
    padding: 100px 10%;
    text-align: center;
}

.section h2 {
    font-size: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    position: relative;
}

.cars {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
}

.car-card {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: 0.4s;
}

.car-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(225,6,0,0.4);
}

.car-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 200px;
    object-fit: cover;
}

.car-info {
    padding: 20px;
}

.car-info h3 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.price {
    color: #e10600;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 20px;
}

.about {
    background: #111;
}

.contact form {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.contact input, 
.contact textarea {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding: 15px;
    border: none;
    background: #1a1a1a;
    color: white;
}

footer {
    background: black;
    padding: 30px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #777;
}

@media(max-width:768px) {
    .hero h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">SPUR <span>AUTO</span> SALES</div>
    <nav>
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#inventory">Inventory</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>DRIVE THE DIFFERENCE</h1>
        <p>Luxury. Power. Performance.</p>
        <button class="btn">View Inventory</button>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="inventory" class="section">
    <h2>Featured Vehicles</h2>
    <div class="cars">
        <div class="car-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552519507-da3b142c6e3d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80">
            <div class="car-info">
                <h3>2023 Mercedes AMG</h3>
                <p class="price">$89,995</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="car-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503376780353-7e6692767b70?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80">
            <div class="car-info">
                <h3>2022 Porsche 911</h3>
                <p class="price">$112,500</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="car-card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1549924231-f129b911e442?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80">
            <div class="car-info">
                <h3>2023 BMW M4</h3>
                <p class="price">$76,990</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="section about">
    <h2>About Spur Auto Sales</h2>
    <p>At Spur Auto Sales, we specialize in premium performance vehicles that turn heads and dominate roads. Our mission is simple: deliver excellence, power, and unmatched customer experience.</p>
</section>

<section id="contact" class="section contact">
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <form>
        <input type="text" placeholder="Full Name" required>
        <input type="email" placeholder="Email Address" required>
        <textarea rows="5" placeholder="Your Message"></textarea>
        <button class="btn">Send Message</button>
    </form>
</section>

<footer>
    © 2026 Spur Auto Sales. All Rights Reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
